// THE ARGUMENT EXPLORER. Purpose: the Argument & evidence view's map and record: a bounded
// argument scope (ARGUMENT_SCOPE_LIMIT) around the current object, its obligations and local
// context, the relationship map (layoutConceptricGraph), and the record pane (concept-reader).
// Ownership: concepts_surface owns objects, relations and the mathematical record;
// research-card.mjs owns result cards; nothing here infers a relation. Public contract:
// projectArgument, argumentScope, clusterArgument, argumentContents, argumentObligations,
// argumentLocalContext, initialArgumentScope, conceptCoverings, namedConceptState,
// placementPresentations and the mounted explorer. Inputs: the concept plan/context reads;
// outputs: DOM and an SVG map painted with the shared tokens. Currentness: the read's revision;
// the shell remembers the scope per project. Errors: a missing object renders its reason.
// Storage: none of its own (the shell keeps the Argument memory).
import {layoutConceptricGraph} from '/shared/conceptric-panes.mjs';
import {renderResearchCard} from '/shared/research-card.mjs';
